  "description": "Situated in the highly popular residential estate on the north side of Enns Town, No. 38 consists of a spacious 4 bedroom semi-detached residence which is located to the front of the estate.\nThe property is located within a few hundred yards of Inis Gael Scoil and is within a 15 minute walk of Ennis town centre and all local amenities.\nIt is close to the M18 Motorway offering easy assess to the major employments hubs in Ennis, Shannon, Limerick and Galway.\nEntrance Hallway with tiled floor, understairs storage.\nSitting Room with solid wood floor, open fireplace with back boiler.\nKitchen area with fitted units, tiled floor, Ffrench doors to patio area.\nSeparate Dining area with polished wood floor.\nDownstairs bedroom with polished wood floor, en-suite fully tiled with electric shower. Plumbed for washing machine / dryer.\nBedroom 2 with polished wood floor, fitted wardrobes.\nBedroom 3 with carpet, fitted wardrobes.\nBedroom 4 with carpet, fitted wardrobes.\nShower Room fully tiled with electric shower.\n \n*** ENQUIRIES BY E-MAIL ONLY PLEASE ***\nWe endeavour to reply to as many enquiries as possible, unfortunately due to the current large volume, everyone will not receive a response.\nCurrent References Only\nNo Pets",
